The agreement specifies that plots are allocated according to a defined rule. Each plot is exactly one acre in size. [[cite-12e468220a986ad602b05b235df6d60914f247b7 "The agreement states that each plot is one acre in size."]]

The allocation rule for plots is that they are distributed based on a lottery system among eligible applicants. [[cite-26e468220a986ad602b05b235df6d60914f247b7 "The agreement states that plots are allocated by lottery among eligible applicants."]]
